<title>PORTUGAL: Portucel plans to enter paper business.</title>
<headline>Portucel plans to enter paper business.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese pulp group Portucel Industrial plans to become involved in the paper production business, chairman Jorge Godinho said.</p>
<p>&quot;As a European pulp producer, we see paper production as a natural development of our business,&quot; Godinho told Reuters Financial Television (RFTV) in an interview.</p>
<p>&quot;Certainly in the future, we will integrate pulp into paper gradually,&quot; he said. He gave no further details.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +(351-1) 3538254</p>
